                            "steamid": "76561198382590749",
                            "num_reviews": 11,
                            "playtime_forever": 45,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 45,
                            "last_played": 1513387868
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great concept of a game, but poorly executed. The wall jumps are very inconsistent, plenty of hacked leaderboard times, and the fov meter doesn't even work, what the hell?\n",
                        "timestamp_created": 1513387952,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1513387952,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 14,
                        "votes_funny": 3,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.6694591045379639,
                        "comment_count": 5,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": true,
                        "developer_response": "Hey! Bummer that you're having issues. I checked the leaderboards, and none of the times are hacks. If you hop on the Discord there are a bunch of people there who will be happy to help you nail the side step speed run maneuver. \n\nAs for the FOV slider, that's a bug I haven't seen before. If you hook me up with system details I can take a look and try to make sure it's fixed in the next patch.\n\nYou're right about wall jumps being difficult. That was by design, but perhaps it's little harder than it should be. I'm open to adjusting the difficulty there if there is some consensus. Stuff like this gets hammered out on the Discord, so stop in!",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1513402389,
                        "primarily_steam_deck": false,
                        "refunded": false
                    }
